        "action_date": "2025-02-27",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Pell Grant Sustainability Act</strong></p><p>This bill indexes&nbsp;the maximum award amount for&nbsp;Pell Grants to the rate of inflation. The bill also permanently reauthorizes the discretionary statutory authority for the Pell Grant program.</p>",
